<title>USA: FirstFed Financial Q4 net income rises.</title>
<headline>FirstFed Financial Q4 net income rises.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA MONICA, Calif. 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>FIRSTFED FINANCIAL CORP</p>
<p>				 3 Mos ended 12/31    12 Mos ended 12/31</p>
<p>					1996    1995     1996     1995</p>
<p> TOTAL INTEREST INCOME	73,788  77,119  297,178   301,735</p>
<p> TOTAL INTEREST EXPENSE     44,521  55,650  198,031   224,077</p>
<p> Net interest income	  29,267  21,469   99,147    77,658</p>
<p> Provision for loan losses   8,455  11,000   35,155    28,376</p>
<p> Net after provision	  20,812  10,469   63,992    49,282</p>
<p> Total other income	    2,676   2,967   10,915     8,725</p>
<p> Non-interest expense	 10,861  11,679   59,175    45,903</p>
<p> Earnings before income taxes 12,627 1,757   15,732    12,104</p>
<p>  Income tax provision	 5,982     909    7,488     5,569</p>
<p> Net earnings		    6,645     848    8,244     6,535</p>
<p> Earnings per share	     0.62    0.08     0.78	0.61</p>
<p> Wgtd avg shrs	  10,648,465  10,662,783 10,636,166 10,655,577</p>
<p>		 (Dollars in thousands, except share data)</p>
